{"id":"n40746-2-9","stage":5,"title":"난청 · 听力障碍","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40746-2-9-1","ko":"우리 아이가 요즘 귀가 잘 안 들린다고 해서 걱정이에요.","zh":"我孩子最近说耳朵听不太清楚，我很担心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"아이가","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이가","audio":"/audio/820c647554b7d3f4fc3a.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"귀가","meaning":"听觉能力","explanation":"귀：听觉能力；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"귀","audio":"/audio/001e793a4472c6fe6269.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60201","senseId":"8","lemma":"귀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀가","audio":"/audio/4522779ada3fab2e2f72.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"들린다고","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들린다고","audio":"/audio/4cb04c3aab3f3377d360.mp3"}},{"text":"해서","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정이에요.","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정이에요","audio":"/audio/026911a52e1dca50bfcd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"(谦词)自己的子女。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"001e793a4472c6fe","term":"귀","zh":"听觉能力","audio":"/audio/001e793a4472c6fe6269.mp3","entryId":"60201","definition":"欣赏某种声音或语言的能力。","pronunciation":["귀"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]}],"audio":"/audio/da2d34511e68f7e66a80.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40746-2-9-2","ko":"난청일지도 모르니 검사를 한번 받아 보세요.","zh":"可能是听力有问题，建议去检查一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난청일지도","meaning":"听力障碍","explanation":"난청：听力障碍；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"난청","audio":"/audio/8379355c6d144230534e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40746","senseId":"2","lemma":"난청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난청일지도","audio":"/audio/2bd9f4a78aa8c7396c60.mp3"}},{"text":"모르니","meaning":"不知道，不确定，也许","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不确定，也许；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"5","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르니","audio":"/audio/56fe6fb0056d9881f6b1.mp3"}},{"text":"검사를","meaning":"检查","explanation":"검사：检查；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"검사","audio":"/audio/cf57fb29da3118185a06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17236","senseId":"1","lemma":"검사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"검사를","audio":"/audio/ea8da3017e61dec99150.mp3"}},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下。","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}},{"text":"받아","meaning":"接，接受","explanation":"받다：接，接受；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"9","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받아","audio":"/audio/0a0a7a563f5137f6e18d.mp3"}},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보세요","audio":"/audio/10b2f8c9f190884edd75.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8379355c6d144230","term":"난청","zh":"听力障碍","audio":"/audio/8379355c6d144230534e.mp3","entryId":"40746","definition":"由于听觉器官出现问题而听不清声音的状态。","pronunciation":["난청"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不确定，也许","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"推测或猜测不确定的事宜。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"cf57fb29da311818","term":"검사","zh":"检查","audio":"/audio/cf57fb29da3118185a06.mp3","entryId":"17236","definition":"调查某事或某个对象，从而判断其对错、好坏。","pronunciation":["검사"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接，接受","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到要求、申请、提问、攻击或信号等的作用，或指对这些做出反应。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1e192bf982ed0216516a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.312,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40746","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":3.7887,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我孩子最近说耳朵听不太清楚，我很担心。","可能是听力有问题，建议去检查一下。","我们分手吧。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我孩子最近说耳朵听不太清楚，我很担心。","可能是听力有问题，建议去检查一下。","我们分手吧。"],"answer":1}]}
